# Stable cross-platform text representation / 稳定的跨平台文本表示
* text=auto
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf

# Office documents and archives are binary / Office 文档与压缩包属于二进制文件
*.docx binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.zip binary

